---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import ResourceHero from '../../blocks/ResourceHero.astro'
import Accordions from '../../blocks/Accordions.astro'

const cards = [1, 2, 3]
---

<Layout title="Connector 1 – RWS UI">
	<ResourceHero layout="wide-text" title="Adobe Experience Manager (AEM)" logo={{ src: '/logos/adobe.svg', alt: 'Adobe' }} description="This integration gives greater control of translation to users of AEM Sites, AEM Assets and XML Documentation for AEM. It adds a range of translation management features directly to AEM, both 6.x and cloud versions, helping AEM users to create and manage multilingual content much more easily." cta={{ href: '#form', text: 'Find out more' }} image={{ src: 'https://www.rws.com/media/dynamic/images/hallucinations_tcm228-295285.webp?original=.png&v=20260402100433', alt: 'Placeholder' }} />

	<section class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="dots-enhanced">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl gap-8 px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12 xl:gap-12">
			<aside class="hidden lg:col-span-4 lg:block">
				<div class="sticky top-20 grid gap-8 xl:gap-12">
					<div hidden class="relative rounded-lg p-10" data-card>
						<!-- <h4 class="mb-6 text-lg font-bold">Key details</h4> -->

						<ul class="grid gap-4">
							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Client</p>
								<p>Alibaba Group</p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Webite</p>
								<p><a href="https://www.alibaba.com" target="_blank">alibaba.com</a></p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Connector type</p>
								<p>Technology connector</p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Product</p>
								<p>Tridion</p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Solution</p>
								<p>Language Platforms</p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Industry</p>
								<p>Life sciences</p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Service areas</p>
								<p>Translation localisation</p>
							</li>

							<li>
								<p class="font-bold">Region</p>
								<p>Argentina</p>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="rounded-lg p-6" data-card>
						<div class="flex items-start gap-6">
							<div class="w-1/3 max-w-24 shrink-0">
								<img src="https://placehold.co/200" alt="Placeholder" class="aspect-square size-full rounded object-cover" />
							</div>
							<div>
								<h4 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Lorem ipsum dolor</h4>

								<div class="prose mb-4 text-sm/normal font-medium text-foreground-muted">
									<p>Tenetur et nesciunt neque, asperiores dolorem repudian, tempora provident fugit?</p>
								</div>

								<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Get connector</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</aside>

			<article class="col-span-full grid items-start gap-8 lg:col-span-8 xl:gap-12">
				<div class="rounded-lg p-6 lg:p-10" data-card>
					<div class="prose max-w-none font-medium text-pretty lg:text-lg">
						<p>Within AEM it offers:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>A project creation wizard, guiding users to push content to Trados for translation</li>
							<li>An option to approve the cost before translation proceeds</li>
							<li>A detailed project overview, showing project workflow status</li>
							<li>A scheduler to automate retrieval of translated content back from Trados</li>
						</ul>
						<h2>What we offer</h2>
						<p>Nulla congue dictum arcu. Aliquam iaculis ultrices pretium. Etiam nec tortor varius, consequat augue vitae, efficitur massa. Interdum et malesuada fames ac ante ipsum primis in faucibus. Praesent feugiat facilisis arcu nec tincidunt. Sed hendrerit ante ac felis ultrices, vel sollicitudin sem imperdiet. Praesent pretium lobortis viverra.</p>
						<h2>How it works</h2>
						<p>Praesent sed lacinia tortor, et convallis lacus. Donec convallis tellus eu nibh blandit, vel venenatis lectus malesuada. Phasellus ut sapien viverra, gravida mauris vitae, tincidunt dui. Praesent accumsan faucibus arcu et tempor. Vivamus lacinia felis non dui rhoncus volutpat. Pellentesque eleifend libero euismod dictum elementum. Integer egestas a enim quis venenatis. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas. Etiam est urna, condimentum sed ultrices sed, mollis eget tortor. Donec dolor erat, scelerisque eget odio id, elementum lobortis augue. Quisque pellentesque in dolor sit amet viverra. Sed sit amet nisl pulvinar, mollis velit vitae, iaculis nisl. Nulla blandit vitae metus sed laoreet. Nam at tortor vitae erat molestie vulputate. Nullam sollicitudin non mi vitae vulputate. Quisque hendrerit nulla egestas velit gravida vehicula et quis augue.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- FAQs -->
	<Accordions theme="default" variant="panel-swap" />
	<!-- variant="side-by-side" -->

	<!-- Related articles -->
	<section hidden class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="default">
		<div class="text-center- *:mx-auto- mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 lg:px-12">
			<!-- Subheading -->
			<div hidden class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
				<p>This is the subheading</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Heading -->
			<h2 class="mb-6 max-w-[24ch] text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-pretty xl:text-5xl">
				<p>Related <em>articles</em></p>
			</h2>

			<!-- Copy -->
			<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground-muted md:prose-lg">
				<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elitera. Suspendisse luctus tortor placerat erat consequat, pellentesque venenatis felis posuere.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-12 grid max-w-[80ch] gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-16 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3">
				{
					cards.map((card) => (
						<>
							{/* Variant 1: full-card clickable + author info */}
							<article class="group relative rounded-lg border border-foreground-softer text-left" data-card>
								<div class="flex h-full flex-col">
									<div class="p-4">
										<div class="mb-5 block overflow-hidden rounded">
											<img class="aspect-video object-cover transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" src="https://flowbite.s3.amazonaws.com/blocks/marketing-ui/blog/office-laptops.png" alt="office laptop working" />
										</div>

										<span class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full border border-foreground-softer bg-foreground-softest px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-foreground-muted"> Article </span>

										<h2 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold">
											<p>
												<a href="/resources/blog-1/">
													This is an article title
													<span class="absolute inset-0" />
												</a>
											</p>
										</h2>

										<div class="prose line-clamp-3 font-medium text-pretty text-foreground-muted">
											<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elitera. Suspendisse luctus tortor placerat erat consequat, pellentesque.</p>
										</div>
									</div>

									<div class="mt-auto px-4 pb-4">
										<div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
											<img class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full" src="https://flowbite.s3.amazonaws.com/blocks/marketing-ui/avatars/jese-leos.png" alt="Jese Leos avatar" />
											<div>
												<div class="font-semibold">Jese Leos</div>
												<div class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground-muted">Aug 15, 2021 • 16 min read</div>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</article>
						</>
					))
				}
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Call to action + form -->
	<section id="form" class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="pale">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl items-center gap-12 px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12 xl:gap-16">
			<div class="lg:col-span-7">
				<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
					<p>This is the subheading</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight xl:text-5xl">
					<p>This is the heading</p>
				</h2>

				<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground-muted md:prose-lg">
					<p>Donec ut cursus est. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse luctus tortor placerat erat consequat, pellentesque venenatis felis.</p>

					<ul>
						<li>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing.</p>
						</li>
					</ul>

					<p>Aenean aliquet tellus nec tempor semper. Etiam finibus ex ac neque semper interdum. Nam in mauris vitae enim egestas euismod semper sit amet.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary btn-icon-right">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><line x1="40" y1="128" x2="216" y2="128" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line><polyline points="168 80 216 128 168 176" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline></svg>
						Find out more
					</a>
				</div>

				<hr hidden class="mt-12 mb-8 border-foreground-softer" />

				<!-- Stats -->
				<div hidden class="mt-8">
					<!-- border-t border-foreground-softer pt-8 -->
					<ul class="@container/stats flex flex-wrap justify-start gap-x-[min(5cqi,2rem)] gap-y-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]">
						<li class="flex items-center">
							<span class="intersect-once text-[min(7.5cqi,3rem)]/none font-extrabold intersect:motion-preset-focus" style="--motion-delay: 200ms">42k</span>

							<div class="intersect-once pl-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)] text-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]/snug font-medium text-foreground-muted intersect:motion-preset-slide-right-sm" style="--motion-delay: 200ms">
								<div>Our Active</div>
								<div>Users</div>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li class="flex items-center">
							<span class="intersect-once text-[min(7.5cqi,3rem)]/none font-extrabold intersect:motion-preset-focus" style="--motion-delay: 300ms">3k</span>

							<div class="intersect-once pl-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)] text-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]/snug font-medium text-foreground-muted intersect:motion-preset-slide-right-sm" style="--motion-delay: 300ms">
								<div>Professional</div>
								<div>Creators</div>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li class="flex items-center">
							<span class="intersect-once text-[min(7.5cqi,3rem)]/none font-extrabold intersect:motion-preset-focus" style="--motion-delay: 400ms">560k</span>

							<div class="intersect-once pl-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)] text-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]/snug font-medium text-foreground-muted intersect:motion-preset-slide-right-sm" style="--motion-delay: 400ms">
								<div>Weekly</div>
								<div>Downloads</div>
							</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="h-full lg:col-span-5">
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-foreground-softer p-8" data-card>
					<h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">
						<p>Book a meeting</p>
					</h3>

					<div class="prose mb-6 font-medium text-foreground-muted">
						<p>We're here to help you with any questions you have. Please fill out the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="hubspot-form">
						<div id="hs_2f5091f7-ff77-4faa-99bd-8af0a538b2d2" class="hs-form-html" data-form-id="80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" data-portal-id="147991" data-activity-type="Contact Form" data-activity-subject="Contact Form: Contact" data-activity-campaign-id="" data-activity-interest-profile="" data-thank-you-message="Thank you for your interest. One of our specialists will be in touch with you soon." data-thank-you-page-url="" data-external-page-url="" data-post-back-on-submit="False" data-resource-url="" data-resource-file-name="" data-on-form-submitted="" data-submit-text="" data-conversion-level="primary" data-form-type="HubSpot" data-region="na1" data-calendly-enabled="False" data-calendly-config-id="" data-calendly-widget="" data-calendly-text="" data-hs-forms-root="true">
							<form id="hsForm_80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" method="POST" accept-charset="UTF-8" enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate="" action="https://forms.hsforms.com/submissions/v3/public/submit/formsnext/multipart/147991/80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" class="hs-form-private hsForm_80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1 hs-form-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1 hs-form-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1_50a5e501-d8e3-426f-9d47-f5ae39a33270 hs-form stacked" target="target_iframe_80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" data-instance-id="50a5e501-d8e3-426f-9d47-f5ae39a33270" data-form-id="80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" data-portal-id="147991" data-test-id="hsForm_80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1">
								<fieldset class="form-columns-2">
									<div class="hs_name hs-name hs-fieldtype-text field hs-form-field">
										<div class="input">
											<label id="label-name-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" class="" for="name-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1">
												<span>Name</span>
												<span class="hs-form-required">*</span>
											</label>

											<input id="name-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" name="name" required="" placeholder="" type="text" class="hs-input hs-field-ready" inputmode="text" autocomplete="name" value="" />
										</div>
									</div>

									<div class="hs_email hs-email hs-fieldtype-text field hs-form-field">
										<div class="input">
											<label id="label-email-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" class="" for="email-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1">
												<span>Email</span>
												<span class="hs-form-required">*</span>
											</label>

											<input id="email-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" name="email" required="" placeholder="" type="email" class="hs-input hs-field-ready" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" value="" />
										</div>
									</div>
								</fieldset>

								<fieldset class="form-columns-1">
									<div class="hs_phone hs-phone hs-fieldtype-phonenumber field hs-form-field">
										<div class="input">
											<label id="label-phone-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" class="" for="phone-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1">
												<span>Phone number</span>
											</label>

											<input id="phone-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" name="phone" placeholder="" type="tel" class="hs-input hs-field-ready" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" value="" />
										</div>
									</div>
								</fieldset>

								<fieldset class="form-columns-2">
									<div class="hs_company hs-company hs-fieldtype-text field hs-form-field">
										<div class="input">
											<label id="label-company-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" class="" for="company-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1">
												<span>Company</span>
												<span class="hs-form-required">*</span>
											</label>

											<input id="company-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" name="company" required="" placeholder="" type="text" class="hs-input hs-field-ready" inputmode="text" autocomplete="organization" value="" />
										</div>
									</div>

									<div class="hs_jobtitle hs-jobtitle hs-fieldtype-text field hs-form-field">
										<div class="input">
											<label id="label-jobtitle-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" class="" for="jobtitle-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1">
												<span>Job title</span>
												<span class="hs-form-required">*</span>
											</label>

											<input id="jobtitle-80943ed9-df96-4201-84bd-0aa63e3f08e1" name="jobtitle" required="" placeholder="" type="text" class="hs-input hs-field-ready" inputmode="text" autocomplete="organization-title" value="" />
										</div>
									</div>
								</fieldset>

								<fieldset class="form-columns-1">
									<div class="legal-consent-container">
										<div class="hs-richtext">
											<p>By entering your personal data you are affirmatively consenting to our use of your personal data and our <a href="https://www.rws.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</fieldset>

								<div class="hs_submit hs-submit">
									<div class="hs-field-desc" style="display: none;"></div>
									<div class="actions">
										<input type="submit" class="hs-button primary large" value="Send" />
									</div>
								</div>
							</form>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
